# Normalise to LF in the repository and in every checkout.
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites line endings on
# checkout. That makes a file on disk hash differently from the blob GitHub serves,
# which cost this project an hour on the SkillCorner basketball clone: five text
# files failed sha256 verification and the checksum was right, the checkout was not.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Data formats are bytes, never text.
*.jsonl binary
*.gz binary
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
